<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>일상 on</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/</link><description>Recent content in 일상 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>엄마아빠랑 파주 헤이리마을</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily2/</link><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily2/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="엄마아빠랑-파주-헤이리마을"&gt;&#10; 엄마아빠랑 파주 헤이리마을&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%97%84%eb%a7%88%ec%95%84%eb%b9%a0%eb%9e%91-%ed%8c%8c%ec%a3%bc-%ed%97%a4%ec%9d%b4%eb%a6%ac%eb%a7%88%ec%9d%84"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-08-23&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb36fbd3-547c-4ad5-adf9-608275baa75f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;긴팔블라우스+데님 착장 ㅎㅎ 파주 가기로 해서 나왔다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41497bae-36ad-4838-9d2d-45ee4198c3a7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;웨이팅하면서 들어온 소품샵인데 요 키링이 딱 눈에 들어왔다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd1a75b8-229d-4a84-b398-cd7272016dd3" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이곳저곳 구경하구&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6cb1fc93-5d30-4bef-85d2-548580d78d0d" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;제일 예뻤던 디피&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4e53b2b-efea-4696-99bf-2a5748aebb1c" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;구경조금 하다가 밥먹으러왔다!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;먹은메뉴중에 젤 마싯었던 샐러드랑 빵.. ㅎ 나머지는 그냥 그랬다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42fa9ad6-3940-4426-b825-07b928b507dd" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4047c18f-2fcb-4107-a5cf-17eee20c396e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;그래도 비주얼은 이쁘다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이런 과자같은 씬피자 별로안좋아하는데 그래도 한조각은 먹었당&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2aebe8d4-3414-42e4-95ab-3b2ba6b4e56b" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e987175-2b13-4328-bc93-da4542d07e30" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;소품샵 몇개 구경해주고,,&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;아까 본 키링이랑 엄마가 이뿌다고 사준 접시 하나 사왔다 ㅎㅎ&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>비내리는 주말과 수요일</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily1/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/daily1/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="비내리는-주말과-수요일"&gt;&#10; 비내리는 주말과 수요일&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%eb%b9%84%eb%82%b4%eb%a6%ac%eb%8a%94-%ec%a3%bc%eb%a7%90%ea%b3%bc-%ec%88%98%ec%9a%94%ec%9d%bc"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-08-19&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f69d907b-f096-4b33-817e-9086c56e5062" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;비가 내리다말다 했던 토요일 아침&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;음악 들으면서 못다한 집정리를 마저 했다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50d9b383-bd91-40be-ae68-3a587094af4c" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;반짝반짝한 바닥 ㅎㅎ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b436a038-336e-4cf5-9c87-543e38c29e0f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;점심으로 프레퍼스 시켜먹으면서 피의게임 보기&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2db2065f-0b41-44f4-b2d4-4a2a5113ccb7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;오랜 숙원 사업(?)이었던 행거 정리도 하구&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5bea923-2d2d-43f1-96ce-c51a2feecb47" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;냉장고 정리도 했다. ㅎㅎ&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3013851-7be6-4fe7-adac-f52da345b62e" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;그리고 읽고싶던 책이 배송온 월요일 저녁!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a56e34e6-9c34-45c6-a688-be6c6d5ef4f5" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;뭘 먼저 읽을까 고민하다가 포닝을 읽기 시작했는데 정말 많은 위로가 되었다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac178542-9df0-4c0b-b23e-7fac6fcc0df6" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;화요일 긴장한채로 출근했는데 생각보다 평화롭게 흘러갔다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="1706" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2cab95d7-0157-429c-b41a-dccb24a91337" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;점심시간에 한끼바 먹으면서 포닝을 읽었다 혼자만의 평화로운 시간이 좋았다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>첫면접</title><link>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/career5/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yshghid.github.io/docs/hobby/daily/career5/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="첫면접"&gt;&#10; 첫면접&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%b2%ab%eb%a9%b4%ec%a0%91"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2025-07-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/047117a4-5d78-4076-a6ee-b5be74d7236e" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1460" height="1742" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2edb8fa4-e759-4786-8523-ec6d9a604ba7" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7a5a91f-39aa-4305-a898-eaa3d39ea9e7" alt="image" /&gt;&#10;&lt;img src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84884c6c-5a69-4f9f-93ca-0f3c945bb0ae" alt="image" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;새로산기여운케이스랑 마고플레인이랑 저속노화좌 없었으면 멘탈 부셔졌을거같은데 다행히 마무리까지끝냈다&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;준비하는동안 24기광수책이랑 정희원의저속노화 너무 읽고싶었는데 이제읽을수있으니까 좋다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>